From: NovaLinux builders <nova@novastation>
Subject: [PATCH] Goldmont Plus (Pentium N5030) defaults

- Prefer schedutil
- 1000 Hz for snappy UI
- Default cmdline disables unused Spectre mitigations on this Atom-class SoC
  (the live image also sets these on the boot command line)

This is an original NovaLinux configuration patch, not derived from another
desktop environment.

---
# Applied via .config fragment during the automated build:
# CONFIG_CPU_FREQ_DEFAULT_GOV_SCHEDUTIL=y
# CONFIG_HZ_1000=y
# CONFIG_CMDLINE="quiet loglevel=3 mitigations=off intel_idle.max_cstate=4"
# CONFIG_DRM_I915=y
# CONFIG_DRM_SIMPLEDRM=y
# KCFLAGS=-march=goldmont-plus -mtune=goldmont-plus -O2 -pipe
